PromptLang includes a patch and additional source files for OpenAI Codex.
OpenAI Codex is licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.
Upstream: https://github.com/openai/codex
Pinned release: rust-v0.154.0

PromptLang's modifications add lexical instruction highlighting to the terminal
composer. PromptLang is an independent prototype and is not an official OpenAI
plugin or release.

The Pi extension and Claude Code external editor use the separately installed
@earendil-works/pi-tui and @earendil-works/pi-coding-agent packages (MIT).
Their source and licenses remain in their npm distributions.
Upstream: https://github.com/earendil-works/pi

Claude Code is a separate proprietary product. PromptLang does not redistribute
Claude Code. Native setup patches a separate local copy of the user's installed
Claude binary. An external-editor fallback is also provided.

The native integration was informed by Piebald-AI/tweakcc (MIT) and Bun's module
graph format (MIT). These projects are not runtime dependencies.
https://github.com/Piebald-AI/tweakcc
https://github.com/oven-sh/bun
